   - Do NOT change the factual content of the narration
   - Maintain the original educational intent
   - Keep the total speaking duration close to {{ scene_duration | default(30) }} seconds
     (approximately {{ (scene_duration | default(30) * 2.5) | int }} words at 150 WPM)

